    {
      "id": "jiWCLzvbHLKTaGJwyYdlz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4668.280228853789,
      "y": -378.0765744703998,
      "width": 521.055419921875,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 159317455,
      "version": 252,
      "versionNonce": 1066137153,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750480654993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFR:\n    1. high concurrent booking. \n    2. consistent in case of booking. \n    3. high availability.  ( in worst case, consistency > availability ) \n    4. alert and monitoring. \n    5. scalable.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NFR:\n    1. high concurrent booking. \n    2. consistent in case of booking. \n    3. high availability.  ( in worst case, consistency > availability ) \n    4. alert and monitoring. \n    5. scalable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gmG_nJg9R6eRQslxI3UBn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4668.6910203778525,
      "y": -244.51589285411,
      "width": 521.2315063476562,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 647380559,
      "version": 288,
      "versionNonce": 1279309071,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750480898352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimations: \n   1. MAU -> 10M -> 10^7\n   2. qps -> \n         a. search -> 50% -> 500K daily -> ~6qps -> peak -> 60 qps\n         b. booking -> worst -> 10% ->  50k -> 1 hour -> 100 qps. \n   3. storage -> later. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Estimations: \n   1. MAU -> 10M -> 10^7\n   2. qps -> \n         a. search -> 50% -> 500K daily -> ~6qps -> peak -> 60 qps\n         b. booking -> worst -> 10% ->  50k -> 1 hour -> 100 qps. \n   3. storage -> later. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AZXfOSGKeFkXYpG0bj9lm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4668.702512935966,
      "y": -112.04731553349995,
      "width": 757.0714111328125,
      "height": 1060,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1557396815,
      "version": 2287,
      "versionNonce": 1631537857,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750482067746,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Entity: \n - user, city, theatre, movie show, movie, ticket, booking\n\nApi design:\n \n    1. search  gprc / https -> simplicity -> https\n\n     header -> x-token, x-traceId,\n\n\n     POST      /api/v1.search\n\n     paginated api\n\n     Request: \n\n      {\n            filters: {\n               title: <>\n               date: <>\n            },\n            sorting: {\n               date: true,\n            },\n            paginated: {\n                pageSize: <>\n                offset: <>\n            }\n            requestMeta: { \n               appName: <> \n               globalContextId: <>\n               .. \n            }\n      }\n\n       Response: {     // status code , 5xx, 4xx, 2xx\n              pageSize: \n              offset: \n              moviveLIst: [\n                   {\n                        movieId, \n                        name, city, theatre, etc. \n                    }, \n                   {}\n               ]\n               \n \n       }\n        \n      2. /api/v1/movie/?movieId =\"\"  \n      3. /api/v1/movie/seat/?movieId\n      4. /api/v1/booking/. POST { movieId, seats: [], date: , x-token , sessionId} -> {bookingId}\n      5. third party -> payment  ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entity: \n - user, city, theatre, movie show, movie, ticket, booking\n\nApi design:\n \n    1. search  gprc / https -> simplicity -> https\n\n     header -> x-token, x-traceId,\n\n\n     POST      /api/v1.search\n\n     paginated api\n\n     Request: \n\n      {\n            filters: {\n               title: <>\n               date: <>\n            },\n            sorting: {\n               date: true,\n            },\n            paginated: {\n                pageSize: <>\n                offset: <>\n            }\n            requestMeta: { \n               appName: <> \n               globalContextId: <>\n               .. \n            }\n      }\n\n       Response: {     // status code , 5xx, 4xx, 2xx\n              pageSize: \n              offset: \n              moviveLIst: [\n                   {\n                        movieId, \n                        name, city, theatre, etc. \n                    }, \n                   {}\n               ]\n               \n \n       }\n        \n      2. /api/v1/movie/?movieId =\"\"  \n      3. /api/v1/movie/seat/?movieId\n      4. /api/v1/booking/. POST { movieId, seats: [], date: , x-token , sessionId} -> {bookingId}\n      5. third party -> payment  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4sGsHjSeqo5Wdj3Kxnirz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5468.16677387144,
      "y": -478.7906282236861,
      "width": 322.8316955566406,
      "height": 740,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 80,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 528735503,
      "version": 238,
      "versionNonce": 1443254401,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1750484519789,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "db schema:\n\n     User\n      - id, name, email, phno. \n     Movie\n     - id, name, createdtime, ...... \n     City\n     - id, name, state, country.....\n     theatre\n     - id, name, cityId ... \n     TheatreShow\n     - id, threatreId, showId, available.\n     MovieShow\n      - theatreid\n      - threadshowId\n      - movieId,\n      - statetime, endtime, date etc. \n    MoveSeat\n      - movieshowId\n      - seatId \n      - available \n    booking\n     - bookingId\n     - sessionId // expire.\n     - movieseats. \n     - price\n     - status -> pending, failed, completed\n     - created time\n  payment\n     - bookingId\n     - price\n     - paymentId\n     - status -> pending, failed, success\n   session -> login\n      - sessoinid\n      - userId\n      - expireon",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "db schema:\n\n     User\n      - id, name, email, phno. \n     Movie\n     - id, name, createdtime, ...... \n     City\n     - id, name, state, country.....\n     theatre\n     - id, name, cityId ... \n     TheatreShow\n     - id, threatreId, showId, available.\n     MovieShow\n      - theatreid\n      - threadshowId\n      - movieId,\n      - statetime, endtime, date etc. \n    MoveSeat\n      - movieshowId\n      - seatId \n      - available \n    booking\n     - bookingId\n     - sessionId // expire.\n     - movieseats. \n     - price\n     - status -> pending, failed, completed\n     - created time\n  payment\n     - bookingId\n     - price\n     - paymentId\n     - status -> pending, failed, success\n   session -> login\n      - sessoinid\n      - userId\n      - expireon",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
