      "updated": 1750492627173,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "entity: \n   user, chat, message, groupMeta, group member\n\napi design: \n\n1. /api/v1/listchats  https: GET\n    header -> x-token. \n    response: {chats: [{ type: , name: , profileLink: , lastMessge: },.....]}\n2. /api/v1/chat/chatId=\"\"&&pagesize=\"\"&&offset=\"\"  GET Paginated\n    response: {messges: [{messageId, createtimestamp, updatetimestsamp, text, userId, previousmessageId},....]}\n3. /api/v1/ws/chat/?chatId=\"\"\n   header -> upgrade, require for websockets.\n   server -> change this to websocket connection\n                depending upon the headers. \n4. ws://<url>/ws/chat/\n   UI -> server send message -> { chatId, message, x-token, previousmsgId}\n   server -> UI -> {.... }\n\ndb schem:\n\nuser:\n- userid, name, pic, phoneno., status, about .... \nchat:\n- chatid, type (OneToOne, Group), createdtime, chatMeta: {{name, createdtime, createdby, profilepic etc }.}\nmessages:\n- messageid, chatid, text, author, perviousMsgId, timestamp etc. \ngroupMember:\n- chatId, userId, status\n\nFlows: \n1. get list ->  select* from message where chatId=\"\"\n                 order by createtimestamp desc.\n                 limit 10 \n2. \n     \n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "entity: \n   user, chat, message, groupMeta, group member\n\napi design: \n\n1. /api/v1/listchats  https: GET\n    header -> x-token. \n    response: {chats: [{ type: , name: , profileLink: , lastMessge: },.....]}\n2. /api/v1/chat/chatId=\"\"&&pagesize=\"\"&&offset=\"\"  GET Paginated\n    response: {messges: [{messageId, createtimestamp, updatetimestsamp, text, userId, previousmessageId},....]}\n3. /api/v1/ws/chat/?chatId=\"\"\n   header -> upgrade, require for websockets.\n   server -> change this to websocket connection\n                depending upon the headers. \n4. ws://<url>/ws/chat/\n   UI -> server send message -> { chatId, message, x-token, previousmsgId}\n   server -> UI -> {.... }\n\ndb schem:\n\nuser:\n- userid, name, pic, phoneno., status, about .... \nchat:\n- chatid, type (OneToOne, Group), createdtime, chatMeta: {{name, createdtime, createdby, profilepic etc }.}\nmessages:\n- messageid, chatid, text, author, perviousMsgId, timestamp etc. \ngroupMember:\n- chatId, userId, status\n\nFlows: \n1. get list ->  select* from message where chatId=\"\"\n                 order by createtimestamp desc.\n                 limit 10 \n2. \n     \n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
